schemas/excel.json, schemas/word.json and schemas/powerpoint.json are byte-preserved
copies of the canonical tool schema artifacts from the Hermes Office Live native
bridge plugin (hackathon-office-live; excel.json at ed09456961ce95186fe7318bfbc0aa075340bd2b).
validation.py reuses that plugin's schema validator. The OneNote tool schemas (onenote.py) are
original to this plugin; addin/dev/demo-notebook.json is invented demo content.

scripts/live/make_taskpane_doc.py applies the same transform as Microsoft's MIT-licensed
office-addin-dev-settings sideload helper to a template read from a local install; no
Microsoft template is included in this repository.

